  No third-party ephemeris or calendrical binary is loaded at runtime.
  Event time is stored as unix_ms_ut1_proxy: TT minus the frozen Delta T model,
  encoded in Unix milliseconds as a UT1-as-UTC comparison proxy. It is not an
  unqualified exact historical UTC timestamp; per-event model guards apply.

